{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/init(status:description:size:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/body"]},{"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/IconStatus","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/Size"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/View-Implementations"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An icon element that can be used at the leading or trailing position of a list item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemIcon","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" displays a status icon (info, warning, positive, negative) with a predefined asset,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a custom neutral icon from a provided image. Each icon type has a semantic color applied automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the current theme.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional notification badge can be attached to neutral icons to indicate additional status.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Status","anchor":"Status","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/IconStatus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines the available icon variants:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".neutral(asset:badge:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A custom icon from a provided ","type":"text"},{"code":"Image","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" asset, rendered with the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content color. An optional notification badge (small dot) can be displayed at the top-trailing corner.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".positive","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined checkmark\/confirmation icon with a positive (green) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".info","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined information icon with an informational (blue) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".warning","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined warning icon with a warning (yellow\/orange) semantic color.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This icon uses a two-layer rendering with distinct internal and external shape colors.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".negative","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined alert\/important icon with a negative (red) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Sizes","anchor":"Sizes","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemIcon\/Size","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines the available sizes:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".medium","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetMedium","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetLarge","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" When the icon is embedded in a list item with small size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(via ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftUI\/View\/oudsListItemSize(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"size","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Info icon with medium size (default)","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"Something new\")","","    \/\/ Warning icon with large size","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"Mobile data almost used\", size: .large)","","    \/\/ Negative icon with medium size","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .negative, description: \"Payment failed\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon without badge","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), descritpion: \"Emails\"))","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon with notification badge","    OUDSListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), description: \"New emails received\", badge: true))","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Information\")),","        leading: .icon(OUDSListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Warning\")),","        trailing: .icon(OUDSListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemicon"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents16OUDSListItemIconV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSListItemIcon","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemIcon","kind":"identifier